    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d944">

                <pb facs="1193" n="1175" sameAs="frus:frus1946v11/pg1175"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">834.00/3–446: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Paraguay</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Beaulac</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Asunción</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-03-04T04:10:00-04:00">March 4, 1946—4:10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 3:29 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>100. President confirmed to me this morning plan to hold elections for Congress
                    this year. I expressed hope Liberal Party as such would not be barred from
                    elections. He said status of Liberal Party would be decided by the courts.</p>
                <p>He again expressed hope we would help to reorganize Paraguayan police as
                    necessary aid to development of democratic institutions in Paraguay. I said it
                    would not be possible for us to do anything at this stage but that we might be
                    helpful after positive steps toward democratization had been taken.</p>
                <p>President expressed gratitude for extension of Stica<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d944-f1"/> agreement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaulac</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d944-f1" n="3" xml:id="d944-f1-content">
                <p>Servicio Técnieo Interamericano de Cooperación Agrícola, an agriculture
